{"3587760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sime Is Back 18+", "steam_appid": 3587760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587760/extras/b19cf6deebe30c50656bd11cbb347448.avif?t=1781039839\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587760/extras_big/b19cf6deebe30c50656bd11cbb347448.avif?t=1781039839 width=800 height=316 /></span>Sime Is Back<i> </i>18+  takes the beloved retro-inspired platformer into full chaos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling underground temple and travel to a different worlds, collect shiny diamonds and keys, and unlock new levels in a mysterious world hub packed with that nostalgic charm you’ve come to love. It’s everything you’d expect from a fun, lighthearted 3D platformer…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until it isn’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits behind the final doors is nothing you could have anticipated. The game takes a sharp, unexpected turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>Classic 3D Platforming… at First</strong> – Run, jump, and collect in a nostalgic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Solve Creative, Action-Based Puzzles</strong> - Defeat enemies and progress through the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>A World Hub</strong> – Unlock new areas and uncover the mysteries of the underground temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 <strong>Collect Diamonds</strong> - Progress and unlock bonuses throughout the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👀 <strong>A Completely Normal Ending…</strong> – Nothing weird happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587760/extras/e